        <t:profileDesc xmlns:t="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
            <t:creation notBefore="1600" notAfter="1700"/>
            <t:abstract>
                <t:p>The "Image" of <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS12143AkalaKr">ʾabbā ʾAkāla Krǝstos</t:persName>, a 17th century Gondarine prince who entered monastic life and in time became a great ascetic. The text is attributed to a monk of Mǝdra Sayko named ʾIsāyǝyyās, being dictated to a certain Zakkāryas. Its composition is described in the second miracle attributed to ʾAkāla Krǝstos.</t:p>
            </t:abstract>
